<title>JAPAN: Japan banks' problem loans at 29.23 trln yen - MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan banks' problem loans at 29.23 trln yen - MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Problem loans at Japan's deposit taking financial institutions totalled 29.23 trillion yen at the end of September, the Finance Ministry (MOF) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Uncovered loan losses at the financial institutions were estimated at 7.3 trillion yen, it also said.</p>
</text>
